 أنك نسيت\r\n                                    كلمة المرور الخاصة بك!. &nbsp;تلقينا طلبا لإعادة تعيين كلمة المرور لحسابك.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">لإعادة تعيين كلمة المرور الخاصة بك ،\r\n                                    انقر فوق الزر أدناه:</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\"><a href=\"{reset_url}\" style=\"background:{secondary-color}; color:{secondary-inverse-color}; text-decoration:none;font-size:16px; font-weight:500;padding:10px 30px;display:inline-block;border-radius:3px;\">نقر\r\n                                        هنا</a></p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\"> أو انسخ والصق ملف\r\n                                    أسفل عنوان URL في متصفحك:<br />\r\n									                                    <a style=\"color: {primary-color};\">{reset_url}</a>                                </p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table> ', '{user_full_name} Name of the email receiver<br>\r\n{reset_url} URL to reset the password<br>\r\n{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 1),
('admin_forgot_password', 3, 'Admin Olvidé mi contraseña Correo electrónico', 'Olvidé mi contraseña Correo electrónico', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    ¡Solicitud de restablecimiento de contraseña!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Estimado {user_full_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Parece que lo olvidaste\r\n                                    ¡Tu contraseña!. &nbsp;Recibimos una solicitud para restablecer la contraseña de su cuenta.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Para restablecer su contraseña,\r\n                                    Haga clic en el botón de abajo:</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\"><a href=\"{reset_url}\" style=\"background:{secondary-color}; color:{secondary-inverse-color}; text-decoration:none;font-size:16px; font-weight:500;padding:10px 30px;display:inline-block;border-radius:3px;\">Clic\r\n                                        aquí</a></p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\"> O copie y pegue el archivo\r\n                                    A continuación, la URL en su navegador:<br />\r\n									                                    <a style=\"color: {primary-color};\">{reset_url}</a>                                </p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table> ', '{user_full_name} Name of the email receiver<br>\r\n{reset_url} URL to reset the password<br>\r\n{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('admin_question_spam_reported', 1, 'Question Reported as Spam - Admin', 'A question reported as spam', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\"> \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\"></h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">Question Reported as Spam!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">Dear Admin</h3> \r\n \r\n								<p> A question has been reported as spam <a style=\"color:{primary-color};\" href=\"{question_view_link}\">{question_title}</a> (Author: {author_full_name}) by {reported_by_full_name}<br />\r\n									</p></td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{reported_by_full_name} Full Name of commenter<br>\r\n{author_full_name} Full Name of Author<br>\r\n{question_title} - Question title<br/>\r\n{question_view_link} - Question View Link<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('admin_question_spam_reported', 2, 'تم الإبلاغ عن السؤال كبريد عشوائي - مشرف', 'سؤال تم الإبلاغ عنه كمحتوى غير مرغوب فيه', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\"> \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\"></h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">تم الإبلاغ عن السؤال كبريد عشوائي!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">عزيزي المشرف</h3> \r\n \r\n								<p> تم الإبلاغ عن سؤال كبريد عشوائي <a style=\"color:{primary-color};\" href=\"{question_view_link}\">{question_title}</a> (المؤلف: {author_full_name}) بواسطة {reported_by_full_name}<br />\r\n									</p></td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{reported_by_full_name} Full Name of commenter<br>\r\n{author_full_name} Full Name of Author<br>\r\n{question_title} - Question title<br/>\r\n{question_view_link} - Question View Link<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('admin_question_spam_reported', 3, 'Pregunta reportada como spam - Admin', 'Una pregunta reportada como spam', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\"> \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\"></h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">¡Pregunta reportada como spam!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">Estimado administrador</h3> \r\n \r\n								<p> Una pregunta ha sido reportada como spam <a style=\"color:{primary-color};\" href=\"{question_view_link}\">{question_title}</a> (Autor: {author_full_name}) por {reported_by_full_name}<br />\r\n									</p></td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{reported_by_full_name} Full Name of commenter<br>\r\n{author_full_name} Full Name of Author<br>\r\n{question_title} - Question title<br/>\r\n{question_view_link} - Question View Link<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0);
INSERT INTO `tbl_email_templates` (`etpl_code`, `etpl_lang_id`, `etpl_name`, `etpl_subject`, `etpl_body`, `etpl_vars`, `etpl_status`, `etpl_quick_send`) VALUES
('approved_withdrawal_request_mail_to_user', 1, 'Approved Withdrawal Request to user', 'Approved withdrawal request on {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    Withdrawal Request</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Dear {user_first_name} {user_last_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Your withdrawal request\r\n                                    for the amount of {withdrawal_amount} has been processed successfully and has been\r\n                                    approved.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Below are the complete\r\n                                    details:</p>                                \r\n								<table style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; border-collapse:collapse;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">                                    \r\n									<tbody>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">Request Date</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{request_date}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">Amount<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"></span></td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{withdrawal_amount}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">Withdrawal Comment</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{withdrawal_comment}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                    \r\n									</tbody>                                \r\n								</table>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{user_first_name} First Name of the email receiver.<br />\r\n{user_last_name} Last Name of the email receiver.<br />\r\n{withdrawal_amount} - Withdrawal Amount<br>\r\n{request_date} - Withdrawal Reqested Date<br>\r\n{withdrawal_comment} - withdrawal comment<br>\r\n{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('approved_withdrawal_request_mail_to_user', 2, 'طلب سحب معتمد للمستخدم', 'تمت الموافقة على طلب السحب على {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    طلب السحب</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    عزيزي {user_first_name} {user_last_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">طلب السحب الخاص بك\r\n                                    لمبلغ {withdrawal_amount} تمت معالجته بنجاح وتم\r\n                                    مصدق.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">فيما يلي التفاصيل الكاملة\r\n                                    التفاصيل:</p>                                \r\n								<table style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; border-collapse:collapse;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">                                    \r\n									<tbody>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">تاريخ الطلب</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{request_date}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">مبلغ<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"></span></td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{withdrawal_amount}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">تعليق السحب</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{withdrawal_comment}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                    \r\n									</tbody>                                \r\n								</table>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{user_first_name} First Name of the email receiver.<br />\r\n{user_last_name} Last Name of the email receiver.<br />\r\n{withdrawal_amount} - Withdrawal Amount<br>\r\n{request_date} - Withdrawal Reqested Date<br>\r\n{withdrawal_comment} - withdrawal comment<br>\r\n{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('approved_withdrawal_request_mail_to_user', 3, 'Solicitud de retiro aprobada al usuario', 'Solicitud de retiro aprobada el {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    Solicitud de retiro</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Estimado {user_first_name} {user_last_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Su solicitud de retiro\r\n                                    por la cantidad de {withdrawal_amount} se ha procesado con éxito y se ha\r\n                                    aprobado.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">A continuación se muestra la información completa\r\n                                    Detalles:</p>                                \r\n								<table style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; border-collapse:collapse;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">                                    \r\n									<tbody>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">Fecha de solicitud</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{request_date}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">Importe<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"></span></td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{withdrawal_amount}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"153\">Comentario de retiro</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"620\">{withdrawal_comment}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                    \r\n									</tbody>                                \r\n								</table>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{user_first_name} First Name of the email receiver.<br />\r\n{user_last_name} Last Name of the email receiver.<br />\r\n{withdrawal_amount} - Withdrawal Amount<br>\r\n{request_date} - Withdrawal Reqested Date<br>\r\n{withdrawal_comment} - withdrawal comment<br>\r\n{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('author_question_reported_request_status_change', 1, 'Question reported request status change - Author', 'Status change on reported question request', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\"> \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\"></h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">Reported Question status change!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">Dear {author_full_name}</h3> \r\n \r\n								<p>Reported request has been \"<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">{status}</span>\" on your question <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\"{question_title}</span>\" reported by <span style=\"font-weigh