                 تم رفض {order_id}.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">لمزيد من التفاصيل يرجى\r\n                                    اتصل بالدعم.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\"><br />شكرا لوجودك معنا!!</p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{order_id} : Order id<br />\r\n{user_name} User name<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('bank_transfer_payment_declined', 3, 'Pago por transferencia bancaria rechazado ', 'Pago por transferencia bancaria rechazado {order_id}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    ¡Pago rechazado!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Estimado {user_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Su pago por la identificación del pedido\r\n                                    {order_id} ha sido rechazado.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Para más detalles, por favor\r\n                                    Póngase en contacto con el servicio de asistencia.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\"><br />Gracias por estar con nosotros!!</p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{order_id} : Order id<br />\r\n{user_name} User name<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('bank_transfer_payment_detail', 1, 'Bank Transfer Payment detail', 'Bank Transfer Payment detail {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">Bank Transfer Payment!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Dear Admin</h3>                                \r\n                              \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">This is an update that the user \"{learner_name}\" has made payment for the order ID {order_id} and shared the payment details.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Please proceed with the order verification and update the status of the order accordingly.</p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>  ', '{order_link} Order Link<br />\r\n{order_id} Order Id<br />\r\n{learner_name} Learner Name<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('bank_transfer_payment_detail', 2, 'تفاصيل الدفع عن طريق التحويل المصرفي', 'تفاصيل الدفع بالتحويل المصرفي {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">الدفع عن طريق التحويل المصرفي!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    عزيزي المشرف</h3>                                \r\n                              \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">هذا تحديث قام المستخدم \"{learner_name}\" بالدفع لمعرف الطلب {order_id} وشارك تفاصيل الدفع.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">يرجى متابعة التحقق من الطلب وتحديث حالة الطلب وفقا لذلك.</p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>  ', '{order_link} Order Link<br />\r\n{order_id} Order Id<br />\r\n{learner_name} Learner Name<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('bank_transfer_payment_detail', 3, 'Transferencia bancaria Detalle del pago', 'Transferencia bancaria Detalle de pago {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">¡Pago por transferencia bancaria!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Estimado administrador</h3>                                \r\n                              \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Se trata de una actualización de que el usuario \"{learner_name}\" ha realizado el pago del ID de pedido {order_id} y ha compartido los detalles de pago.</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Proceda con la verificación del pedido y actualice el estado del pedido en consecuencia.</p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>  ', '{order_link} Order Link<br />\r\n{order_id} Order Id<br />\r\n{learner_name} Learner Name<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('blog_contribution_status_changed', 1, 'Blog Contribution Status Change - Notification', 'Blog Contribution Status Changed at {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    Blog Contribution Status</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Dear {user_full_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Your blog contribution\r\n                                    (submitted on {posted_on_datetime}) status has been updated to {new_status}. </p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{user_full_name} : User full name<br>{posted_on_datetime} : posted date time <br> {new_status} : status<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0);
INSERT INTO `tbl_email_templates` (`etpl_code`, `etpl_lang_id`, `etpl_name`, `etpl_subject`, `etpl_body`, `etpl_vars`, `etpl_status`, `etpl_quick_send`) VALUES
('blog_contribution_status_changed', 2, 'تغيير حالة مساهمة المدونة - إشعار', 'تم تغيير حالة مساهمة المدونة عند {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    حالة مساهمة المدونة</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    عزيزي {user_full_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">مساهمة مدونتك\r\n                                    (تم الإرسال في {posted_on_datetime}) تم تحديث الحالة إلى {new_status}. </p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{user_full_name} : User full name<br>{posted_on_datetime} : posted date time <br> {new_status} : status<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('blog_contribution_status_changed', 3, 'Cambio en el estado de la contribución del blog - Notificación', 'El estado de la contribución del blog ha cambiado en {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    Estado de contribución del blog</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Estimado {user_full_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">Tu contribución al blog\r\n                                    (enviado el {posted_on_datetime}) se ha actualizado a {new_status}. </p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{user_full_name} : User full name<br>{posted_on_datetime} : posted date time <br> {new_status} : status<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 0),
('coming_up_class_reminder', 1, 'Scheduled class(s) Reminder', 'Class Reminder at {website_name}', '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0;\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    Scheduled Class Reminder!</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    Dear {user_full_name}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px;line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\"> Thank you for your\r\n                                    interest in online coaching with us!</p>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px;line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\"> We are here to remind you\r\n                                    of your upcoming online class. Below are the details of the class:</p>                                <br />\r\n								{details}<br />\r\n								                                \r\n								<p style=\"center;font-size: 14px;line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">We recommend to\r\n                                    setup couple of minutes earlier for your session to avoid any problems.</p>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '{user_full_name} Name of the email receiver.<br>{details} Class details<br>{website_name} - Website Name<br>', 1, 1),
