(1002, 1, 'LBL_NECESSARY_COOKIE_DESCRIPTION_TEXT', 'These cookies are essential for the website\'s functionality and cannot be disabled in our systems. They are typically set in response to actions you take, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in, or completing forms. You can adjust your browser settings to block or receive alerts about these cookies, but doing so may affect the functionality of certain parts of the site. These cookies do not store any personally identifiable information.'),
(1003, 1, 'LBL_PREFERENCES_COOKIE_DESCRIPTION_TEXT', 'Preference cookies are essential for system performance and user experience enhancement. The information fetched is aggregated and anonymized before use. Switching these cookies off may affect the working of some or all of the personalization features.'),
(1004, 1, 'LBL_STATISTICS_COOKIE_DESCRIPTION_TEXT', 'These cookies allow us to count visits and analyze traffic sources so we can measure and improve the website performance. They help us to know which pages are the most and least popular and see how visitors move around the site. All information these cookies collect is aggregated and therefore anonymous.'),
